ounts of each 'Codice via' for the conflicting 'Via' values.\n","display(codice_via_counts_for_conflicting_vias)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"l33TDHvoIZU9"},"source":["Since we already checked in the profiling part these Codice via does not belong to any other Via (the FD Codice Via --> Via holded in the original dataset) we can cast these codice via such that also Via --> Codice Via"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"fqEEK6-5oNBG"},"source":["Since there is no typo in the column via we will make the assumption that the most repeated codice via is the true one for the via we are consideing. So we will impute the codice via considerting the most repeated codice via for that \"Via\""]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":179,"status":"ok","timestamp":1763042595770,"user":{"displayName":"Noah Santarossa","userId":"17907350992772638292"},"user_tz":-60},"id":"d4f075f2","outputId":"5b7bb8c0-59c4-48b4-8b2d-1d9e6ac39a10"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Codice via values imputed based on the mode for Vias with multiple associated Codice via values.\n"]}],"source":["# Determine the mode of 'Codice via' for Vias with multiple 'Codice via'\n","# We can reuse the list of vias with multiple codice via from previous steps if available,\n","# otherwise, we will re-calculate it.\n","# Assuming vias_with_multiple_codice_via is available from a previous step.\n","if 'vias_with_multiple_codice_via' not in locals():\n","    print(\"Calculating vias with multiple codice via...\")\n","    codice_via_counts_by_via = df.groupby('Via')['Codice via'].nunique()\n","    vias_with_multiple_codice_via = codice_via_counts_by_via[codice_via_counts_by_via > 1]\n","\n","vias_with_multiple_codice_via_list = vias_with_multiple_codice_via.index.tolist()\n","\n","# Calculate the mode of 'Codice via' for each of these Vias\n","mode_codice_via_by_via = df[df['V